<!--
  Synthetic C-CDA Procedures section. No patient data.

  The narrative table is ordered Procedure, Provider, Date, Comments, so
  reading it by position (name, date, status) stores the provider as the date
  and the date as the status. The entries carry every field explicitly:

    proc-display     Procedure Activity Procedure: SNOMED code with a CPT
                     translation, a time of day, completed, a performer with
                     a specialty and organization, an indication
    proc-original    Procedure Activity Observation: CPT code whose
                     originalText references the narrative cell; a date
                     without a time; active; a service location
    proc-act         Procedure Activity Act, aborted
    proc-code-only   nothing but the CPT code names it
    proc-planned     moodCode INT: planned, not performed
    proc-negated     negationInd: not performed
    proc-unnamed     nothing names it, and its text references its own row

  Every procedure but proc-code-only, proc-planned and proc-negated references
  its row.
-->
